@startuml
title sdbp-review 系统上下文（UML-CTX-001）
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "需求方" as Requester
actor "开发者" as Developer

rectangle "sdbp-review" as Review {
  usecase "接入现存仓库\nUC-REPOSITORY-IMPORT" as Import
  usecase "浏览统一交互图\nUC-MODEL-EXPLORE" as Explore
  usecase "通过对话设计需求\nUC-REQUIREMENT-DESIGN" as Design
  usecase "审查并批准统一图 Diff\nUC-MODEL-APPROVE" as Approve
  usecase "按批准模型实现\nUC-IMPLEMENT" as Implement
  usecase "按场景验证\nUC-VERIFY" as Verify
  usecase "创建带模型 Diff 的 MR\nUC-MR-CREATE" as CreateMr
}

rectangle "目标 Git 仓库" as Repository
rectangle "隔离 Worktree" as Worktree
rectangle "完整测试环境" as TestEnvironment
rectangle "GitLab" as GitLab
rectangle "本机 Codex CLI" as Codex

Requester --> Import
Requester --> Explore
Requester --> Design
Requester --> Approve
Developer --> Explore

Import --> Repository
Explore --> Repository
Design --> Codex
Implement --> Codex
Implement --> Worktree
Verify --> Worktree
Verify --> TestEnvironment
CreateMr --> GitLab

note bottom of Review
唯一主界面：自然语言对话 + 一张分层交互图
需求层与技术设计层未同时批准时禁止进入实现
第一版直接运行在宿主机并调用已登录的 Codex CLI
end note
@enduml
